# tp_and_state: teleport the player and confirm get_state reports the new pos.
# tp moves both the local sim and the server's authoritative position; the
# resulting state line reflects it immediately. (Note: a later `step` lets the
# server reconcile the player back toward its spawn anchor, so we assert right
# after the tp, before stepping.)
> {"cmd":"tp","x":8.5,"y":80.0,"z":-4.5}
expect pos[0] == 8.5
expect pos[2] == -4.5
